<title>USA: Dow industrials off at start.</title>
<headline>Dow industrials off at start.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wall Street stocks were mostly softer at the start of trade on Thursday as the Dow industrials fell prey to profit-taking after a rally which took it above 7,000 for the first time.</p>
<p>The Dow Industrials was off nine at 7,000. The 30-year long bond up 7/32 to yield 6.94 percent.</p>
